{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"中心化子"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"中心化子"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":"同态 $H\\to G$, 定义其<strong>中心化子</strong>为 $H$ 在 $G$ 上"},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":"共轭作用"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"不动点","text":"不动点集"}},{"Plain":", 即\n$$\r\nC_G(H) = \\operatorname{lim}(\\mathbf{B}H\\to\\mathbf{B}G\\overset{\\mathrm{Ad}}{\\to}\\mathsf{Ani}),\r\n$$\n这等价于\n$$\r\nC_G(H) = \\operatorname{Aut}_{\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathbf{B}H,\\mathbf{B}G)}(\\mathbf{B}H \\to \\mathbf{B}G).\r\n$$\n(这是因为函子范畴中的态射集可表示为"},{"Local":{"url":"端","text":"端"}},{"Plain":".)\n进而 $C_G(H)$ 可理解为\n$\\operatorname{Hom}(H,G)$ 上 $G$-作用的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定子","text":"稳定子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>子群 $1\\to G$ 的中心化子为 $G$ 本身:\n$$\r\nC_G(1)=\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathbf{B}H,\\mathbf{B}G)}(* \\to \\mathbf{B}G) = \\Omega\\mathbf{B}G = G.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>子群 $\\mathrm{id}\\colon G \\to G$ 的中心化子为 $G$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"中心","text":"中心"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nC_G(G) = \\operatorname{Aut}_{\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G)}(\\mathrm{id}) = Z(G).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}